{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_L_01", "ok": true, "text": "有关部门表示，将继续加大投入，进一步完善城市公共交通网络体系。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.54}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_L_02", "ok": true, "text": "记者从发布会上了解到，本次合作项目将覆盖全国二十多个主要城市。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.65}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_L_03", "ok": true, "text": "专家指出，数字经济正在成为推动区域协调发展的重要引擎和支撑力量。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.71}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_L_04", "ok": true, "text": "该证据。实施将惠及数千万家庭，显出减轻群众在医疗方面的支出负担。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.7}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_L_05", "ok": true, "text": "随着气温逐渐回升，各地春耕备耕工作陆续展开，农资工业总体充足。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.66}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_L_06", "ok": true, "text": "主办方介绍，本届博览会共设八大展馆，参展企业数量创历史新高。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.65}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_L_07", "ok": true, "text": "数据显示，过去一年，新能源汽车出口大幅增长，占汽车出口总量近三成。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.69}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_L_08", "ok": true, "text": "新县城的体育中心可容纳6万名观众，将成为城市新的地标性建筑。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.74}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_L_09", "ok": true, "text": "研究团队历时五年完成了这项课题，成果已在国际权威期刊上发表。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.69}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_L_10", "ok": true, "text": "政府多措并举促进旅游消费，假期接待游客量同比明显增长。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.66}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_L_11", "ok": true, "text": "这次演习重点演练了应急指挥系统在复杂条件下的协同作战能力。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.66}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_L_12", "ok": true, "text": "经过三个月的紧张施工，这片老旧厂区改造工程顺利通过竣工验收。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.56}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_L_13", "ok": true, "text": "报告认为，绿色低碳转型将为相关产业带来巨大的市场空间和机遇。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.55}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_L_14", "ok": true, "text": "交管部门提醒，节假日期间高速车流量大，出行前请合理规划路线。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.69}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_L_15", "ok": true, "text": "该实验室聚集了一批优秀青年学者，在人工智能领域取得多项原创成果。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.7}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_L_16", "ok": true, "text": "气象台预计，未来三天，北方地区将出现大风降温天气，绝地半有沙尘暴。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.56}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_L_17", "ok": true, "text": "商务部门数据显示，消费市场持续回暖，线上线下融合趋势更加明显。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.61}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_L_18", "ok": true, "text": "这条穿越山脉的隧道全长超过12公里，建设过程中攻克了多项技术难题。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.71}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_L_19", "ok": true, "text": "保护区内已安装两百多个红麦相机，用于监测野生动物的活动规律。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.73}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_L_20", "ok": true, "text": "教育部门表示，今年将继续扩大优质教育资源覆盖面，推进均衡发展。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.68}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_M_01", "ok": true, "text": "国家统计局今天发布了上月经济运行数据。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.4}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_M_02", "ok": true, "text": "些任务，圆满完成全部预定实验项目。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.47}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_M_03", "ok": true, "text": "气象部门提醒市民注意防范强对流天气。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.45}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_M_04", "ok": true, "text": "新开通的城际铁路将两地车程缩短一半。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.48}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_M_05", "ok": true, "text": "专家组对受灾地区展开全面评估工作。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.47}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_M_06", "ok": true, "text": "这家科技公司在海外市场取得重大突破。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.45}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_M_07", "ok": true, "text": "冬季供暖工作目前已经准备就绪。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.34}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_M_08", "ok": true, "text": "市政府宣布启动新一轮老旧小区改造计划。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.39}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_M_09", "ok": true, "text": "研究显示，城市绿地面积与居民健康证相关。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.4}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_M_10", "ok": true, "text": "全运会筹备工作进入最后冲刺阶段。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.46}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_M_11", "ok": true, "text": "相关部门联合开展安全生产大检查。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.43}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_M_12", "ok": true, "text": "新建成的博物馆将于下月正式接待观众。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.49}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_M_13", "ok": true, "text": "今年粮食产量有望再创历史新高。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.41}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_M_14", "ok": true, "text": "该片保护区首次拍到雪豹活动影像。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.44}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_M_15", "ok": true, "text": "主办方预计，本届展会观众将超过10万元。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.5}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_M_16", "ok": true, "text": "医疗队深入山区，为村民提供免费诊疗。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.39}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_M_17", "ok": true, "text": "新航线开通后，旅客出行时间大为缩短。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.34}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_M_18", "ok": true, "text": "有关部门要求各地切实做好防汛准备。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.43}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_M_19", "ok": true, "text": "大桥合龙标志着工程取得关键性进展。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.45}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_M_20", "ok": true, "text": "高校毕业生就业服务周活动今天启动。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.42}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_S_01", "ok": true, "text": "今天，全国大部分地区晴朗。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.38}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_S_02", "ok": true, "text": "股市今日收盘小幅上涨。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.29}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_S_03", "ok": true, "text": "台风明晚登陆沿海地区。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.34}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_S_04", "ok": true, "text": "新地铁线路今天正式开通。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.39}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_S_05", "ok": true, "text": "市民纷纷前往公园赏花。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.35}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_S_06", "ok": true, "text": "会为期五天。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.24}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_S_07", "ok": true, "text": "会议发布了重要声明。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.33}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_S_08", "ok": true, "text": "机场航班进程恢复正常。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.3}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_S_09", "ok": true, "text": "新图书馆下周对外开放。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.26}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_S_10", "ok": true, "text": "鲍鱼。区部分道路积水。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.38}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_S_11", "ok": true, "text": "冠军队伍今晚凯旋归来。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.35}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_S_12", "ok": true, "text": "环保部门启动专项检查。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.34}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_S_13", "ok": true, "text": "物价水平保持总体稳定。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.33}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_S_14", "ok": true, "text": "大熊猫又在首次公开亮相。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.38}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_S_15", "ok": true, "text": "高速公路亲起限时免费。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.35}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_S_16", "ok": true, "text": "艺术节开幕式座无虚席。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.31}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_S_17", "ok": true, "text": "新能源汽车销量再创新高。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.35}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_S_18", "ok": true, "text": "科考队顺利抵达目标去聚。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.38}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_S_19", "ok": true, "text": "城市马拉松报名今日启动。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.34}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D1_S_20", "ok": true, "text": "老街区改造工程正式完工。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.35}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_L_01", "ok": true, "text": "我本来计划这个周末去爬山，但是看天气预报说由于只好改成在家休息了。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.75}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_L_02", "ok": true, "text": "你上次说的那家餐厅，我去了，排了快1个小时的队，不过味道确实不错。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.56}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_L_03", "ok": true, "text": "他从大学毕业后就一直在这家公司工作，前两年终于升上了部门经理。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.69}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_L_04", "ok": true, "text": "我们家孩子今年上小学二年级，每天放学回家都要先看半个小时的画片。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.69}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_L_05", "ok": true, "text": "这两天降温厉害，出门的时候记得多穿点衣服，别又感冒了。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.52}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_L_06", "ok": true, "text": "我最近在考虑换工作，不过现在这个行情还是先谨慎一点比较好。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.64}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_L_07", "ok": true, "text": "昨天在地铁上捡到一个钱包，交给了车站的工作人员，希望失主早点领回去。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.75}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_L_08", "ok": true, "text": "你要是早半个小时出发，肯定就不会赶上晚高峰堵车了。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.57}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_L_09", "ok": true, "text": "我爸妈下个月要来住一段时间，我打算先把自我重新布置一下。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.66}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_L_10", "ok": true, "text": "这个月房租到期了，房东说下个季度每个月要涨200块钱。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.59}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_L_11", "ok": true, "text": "上周同学聚会，好几个人我差点都认不出来了，时间过得真快。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.62}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_L_12", "ok": true, "text": "我昨天晚上失眠，翻来覆去到凌晨三点多才勉强睡着。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.45}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_L_13", "ok": true, "text": "家里的洗衣机用了快八年了，最近老是出毛病，我打算换一台新的。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.58}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_L_14", "ok": true, "text": "你把这段视频发到群里，让大家都看看，挺有意思的。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.5}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_L_15", "ok": true, "text": "周末我们全家去了趟郊区采摘园，孩子玩的特别开心。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.59}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_L_16", "ok": true, "text": "我现在每天早上六点起床跑步，坚持了三个月，感觉精神好多了。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.64}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_L_17", "ok": true, "text": "这栋楼的电梯三天两头坏，物业说下周安排人来彻底检修。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.5}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_L_18", "ok": true, "text": "我同事推荐了一款记账软件，用了一个月，觉得还挺方便的。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.61}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_L_19", "ok": true, "text": "昨天路过商场，看到换季打折，忍不住又买了两件衬衫。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.63}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_L_20", "ok": true, "text": "我和他认识十几年了，从小学开始就是同桌，关系一直特别好。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.6}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_M_01", "ok": true, "text": "我打算下班之后去健身房锻炼1个小时。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.37}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_M_02", "ok": true, "text": "这家火锅店的毛肚特别新鲜，值得。一是。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.44}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_M_03", "ok": true, "text": "你要是觉得累，就早点回去休息吧。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.44}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_M_04", "ok": true, "text": "我上周买的那双鞋，穿着特别舒服。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.31}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_M_05", "ok": true, "text": "咱们周末去郊外走走，放松一下新节目。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.46}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_M_06", "ok": true, "text": "他昨天加班到半夜，今天肯定起不来。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.45}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_M_07", "ok": true, "text": "妈妈说，家里种的西红柿，今年长得特别好。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.47}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_M_08", "ok": true, "text": "你把这个文件打印两份交给前台。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.47}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_M_09", "ok": true, "text": "我最近在学做菜，进展还挺顺利的。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.42}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_M_10", "ok": true, "text": "这部电影的结局完全出乎我的意料。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.43}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_M_11", "ok": true, "text": "你上次推荐的那本书，我刚开始看。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.35}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_M_12", "ok": true, "text": "咱们小区门口的路终于修好了。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.39}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_M_13", "ok": true, "text": "我约了老同学周六上午喝早茶。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.43}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_M_14", "ok": true, "text": "你带伞了吗？外面雨下的挺大的。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.44}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_M_15", "ok": true, "text": "孩子这几天总闹着要去动物园。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.37}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_M_16", "ok": true, "text": "我把书房收拾了一下，现在宽敞多了。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.41}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_M_17", "ok": true, "text": "这个月话费比上个月多了不少。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.35}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_M_18", "ok": true, "text": "你猜今天在电梯里遇到谁了？", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.37}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_M_19", "ok": true, "text": "公司楼下新开的书店，环境很不错。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.44}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_M_20", "ok": true, "text": "我记得把钥匙放在包里了呀。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.36}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_S_01", "ok": true, "text": "周末我们去看电影吧。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.26}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_S_02", "ok": true, "text": "你吃晚饭了没有？", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.29}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_S_03", "ok": true, "text": "这件衣服打折呢。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.24}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_S_04", "ok": true, "text": "我下午去趟超市。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.3}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_S_05", "ok": true, "text": "外面好像要下雨了。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.28}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D2_S_06", "ok": true, "text": "帮我带一杯咖啡。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.3}
