{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D4_M_11", "ok": true, "text": "图书馆开放时间是早上八点到晚上十点。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.51}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D4_M_12", "ok": true, "text": "这次展览展出了其白石的一百多副阵记。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.49}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D4_M_13", "ok": true, "text": "我们定了周日中午12点的位置，一共六个人。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.43}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D4_M_14", "ok": true, "text": "报名截止日期是本月30号，请勿错过。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.48}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D4_M_15", "ok": true, "text": "这条最。60公里全程禁止变道。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.43}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D4_M_16", "ok": true, "text": "据统计，该市常住人口约1200万。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.43}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D4_M_17", "ok": true, "text": "会议手册在酒店三层的签到处领取。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.44}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D4_M_18", "ok": true, "text": "快递单号前四位是7730，尾号49。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.49}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D4_M_19", "ok": true, "text": "本次比赛的冠军奖金是50万元人民币。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.54}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D4_M_20", "ok": true, "text": "新校区位于城东，占地约3000亩。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.41}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D4_S_01", "ok": true, "text": "会议定于三点开始。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.35}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D4_S_02", "ok": true, "text": "火车10点20发车。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.32}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D4_S_03", "ok": true, "text": "他今年32岁。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.24}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D4_S_04", "ok": true, "text": "房间号是1208。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.29}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D4_S_05", "ok": true, "text": "总共花了200元。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.29}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D4_S_06", "ok": true, "text": "电梯坏了，请走楼梯。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.29}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D4_S_07", "ok": true, "text": "我住在朝阳区。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.3}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D4_S_08", "ok": true, "text": "明天是星期五。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.26}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D4_S_09", "ok": true, "text": "预约编号0731。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.32}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D4_S_10", "ok": true, "text": "从这到机场40分钟。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.38}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D4_S_11", "ok": true, "text": "会议改到下周二。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.29}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D4_S_12", "ok": true, "text": "温度零下五度。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.28}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D4_S_13", "ok": true, "text": "这瓶水500毫升。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.32}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D4_S_14", "ok": true, "text": "他的生日在九月。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.32}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D4_S_15", "ok": true, "text": "长江全长六千多公里。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.36}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D4_S_16", "ok": true, "text": "验证码是8866。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.32}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D4_S_17", "ok": true, "text": "一打鸡蛋12个。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.29}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D4_S_18", "ok": true, "text": "飞机下午两点起飞。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.31}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D4_S_19", "ok": true, "text": "台风名叫梅花。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.28}
{"key": "rev_mit/zh_D4_S_20", "ok": true, "text": "王教授来自浙江大学。", "lang": "zh", "usage": {}, "latency_s": 0.33}
